00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.400
Even better!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:58.250
What?

00:18:58.950 --> 00:18:59.850
Call my new soap!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:03.830
Lemur Lovely, made from the rare scent of the ring-tailed lemur

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.570
all the way from Madagascar.

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:08.180
Oh, it's divine.

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:12.840
Yes, excellent, Danita.

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.640
Here, darling, smell this.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:21.460
Wait, you don't understand. You can't just take away the lemur scent marks. They're important messages.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:26.580
And no, it doesn't smell good.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.820
Dobby-o, get me more. I need at least a year's supply.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.580
Gleamer Lovely, just for myself!

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.160
No! You can't do that!

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:35.410
Aviva?

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:39.980
Yes, Danita messed up the territorial boundaries.

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.940
She's collecting the scent marks.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.970
Oh, no! I better re-mark my...

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:48.940
troops boundaries right away while you find Martin so he can do his troops

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:57.460
quick before the lemurs notice um Aviva what's on your face well it's lemur scent

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.740
it's a long story okay tell me

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.620
Come on!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:04.610
Uh, hi, Stink Flicker.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:05.520
Uh-oh.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.280
I think he likes your lemur scent

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.660
and is mad because he thinks I'm taking you away.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.940
Oh, no, not another stink fight match.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.350
You won't let us go.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:15.660
You don't understand.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:19.080
We're just going to fix a mess that this animal fashion lady caused.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:24.700
Your troop and Troop Klingon don't have to fight over

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.780
the updated disc.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.940
Ring-tail lemur two-

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.780
I know, install.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.960
With updated check set, you can stink bite now.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.180
Okay, buddy, I'm calling a rematch.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.340
Let's stink bite, lemur style.

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.210
How do you like that stink?

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.090
Oh, you're good.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:59.960
But check this out, you added a meal.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.670
He's letting us go!

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.380
That chest ink really works!

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:07.550
Hey, trust me, buddy. We just have to fix something over here.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.390
Uh-oh! We're too late!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.200
They're crossing the border right now!

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:14.900
Yikes! If Troop Klingon catches them on their territory,

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.960
there's gonna be a lemur fight.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:23.190
What? Troop Tamarind? On our territory?

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.510
Yes! What are you guys doing?

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:29.980
You're Troop's trespass-

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:34.020
It's Danita! She stole the scent marks!

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:36.140
Oh!

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.060
Gamers even fight with their babies on their backs!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:48.890
This is definitely the sound that woke us up this morning.

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.450
They were fighting about territory for sure!

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.340
But we've got to get those scent marks back in place!

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:06.510
Wake, Martin! We have to restore the natural order!

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:07.710
I'm on it, bro!

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:08.750
Sandmar!

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:13.760
Activate!

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:14.880
Adult ring tail!

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:19.900
Klingon!

00:22:21.580 --> 00:22:23.440
Marking to the creature rescue!

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:25.940
Ring tail lemur style!

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:38.900
Smell it in a tree lemur.

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.140
Well then, I don't like a lemur anymore.

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:47.540
Ooh, lemur soap was a bad idea.

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:49.220
Get me out of here to...

00:22:51.990 --> 00:22:53.290
Aviva, the lemurs!

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:55.460
They're going back to their territories.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:58.780
The territorial boundaries are restored.

00:22:59.340 --> 00:22:59.660
Whew!

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:05.680
Well, mission accomplished.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:08.980
We figured out what the Ring-tailed Lemur Troops' fight was about.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:10.040
Territory.

00:23:10.300 --> 00:23:10.980
That's right.

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.290
To protect their food, their home turf.

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:18.100
And communication with smells is the key for lemurs to talk with each other.

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:19.620
With scent marks...

00:23:20.220 --> 00:23:20.880
Stink fights.

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.260
Okay, then come over here and grab a seat.

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:27.860
Because we've got a great stink fight match about to begin.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:29.940
Green Stench versus Blue.

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:31.760
Take that!

00:23:33.080 --> 00:23:35.220
Oh, bad, bro!

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.320
But not as bad as this!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:42.940
And may the stinkiest brother win!

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:51.400
So ring-tailed lemurs, like lots of animals,

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.680
use scent for certain types of communication.

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:56.020
And if you follow a troop around for a while,

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:57.600
you'll find out why.

00:23:57.860 --> 00:23:58.740
Oh, there they go.

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:07.360
check out what the ringtails found. A lush green ficus tree and it's filled with fruit.

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:12.870
Now these ringtail lemurs are picky. They're making their way through the tree sniffing

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:17.870
at the little bunches of fruit but they're only picking the ripest ones to eat. They're

00:24:17.870 --> 00:24:22.610
gonna eat those today and save the rest for tomorrow and the upcoming days when they'll

00:24:22.610 --> 00:24:27.670
return to this tree making their daily rounds and then again pick only the ripest fruits.

00:24:27.670 --> 00:24:29.900
It's trees like these that the ring

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:35.420
lemur troop has to protect that's why they call in the morning that's why they scent mark around

00:24:35.420 --> 00:24:41.950
their range because they have to protect their food resources and trees like these the lemurs

00:24:41.950 --> 00:24:48.740
have this whole area scent marked yeah what they do is they have spurs on their wrists right next

00:24:48.740 --> 00:24:55.140
to some scent glands and they slash at the little saplings injecting their scent into the sapling

00:24:55.140 --> 00:24:58.790
Now, we can't smell it, but other lemur troops sure can.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:03.940
warns the other troops, saying, this is our home, stay out.

00:25:04.860 --> 00:25:09.440
Yeah, they have to protect an area that's big enough with enough food to feed all the

00:25:09.440 --> 00:25:15.140
members of the troop, including the little guys, and a perfect chance for the baby lemur

00:25:15.140 --> 00:25:16.400
to get some climbing practice.

00:25:16.720 --> 00:25:19.600
He's only two weeks old, so he's not going too far from mom yet.

00:25:20.140 --> 00:25:24.220
He always wants to be a quick jump onto her back, cling on, because you never know when

00:25:24.220 --> 00:25:26.280
the lemur troop is going to be off and moving again.

00:25:26.860 --> 00:25:29.980
For ring-tailed lemurs, smell helps determine rank.

00:25:30.380 --> 00:25:31.900
That's where stink fights come in.

00:25:32.280 --> 00:25:34.000
Let the stinkiest lemur win.

00:25:35.960 --> 00:25:39.140
Whoa, he was just sending a stink message right there.

00:25:39.340 --> 00:25:41.340
He charged up his tail with the stink

00:25:41.340 --> 00:25:43.930
and then flicked it at the other lemur.

00:25:45.350 --> 00:25:46.990
But when it came down to it,

00:25:47.110 --> 00:25:49.330
he didn't want to have a full-on stink fight.

00:25:51.370 --> 00:25:54.770
So those are the ring-tailed lemurs of Madagascar.

